{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2014-03", "window": 3, "start_date": 1394928000, "end_date": 1395619199, "month_true_total": 229, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:08:12 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "9611950", "author": {"steamid": "76561197990581375", "personaname": "Xpekt", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197990581375/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 2972, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2942, "last_played": 1395612970, "avatar": "db8f0d80ca46a18bc3bb730858ade910fbf5956b"}, "language": "english", "review": "A great Adventure/platformer with adictive achievements and unlocks, and some roguelike elements to it.\n\nspeaking of achievements i just got mine for writing this reviews, peace, 9/10", "timestamp_created": 1395609206, "timestamp_updated": 1395609206, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9608587", "author": {"steamid": "76561197981939445", "personaname": "Garstank", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/garstank/", "num_games_owned": 364, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 2390, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 555, "last_played": 1492573178, "avatar": "6cd47f3949ef159fabcb283de21973b14cecb52d"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's real good. Get it.", "timestamp_created": 1395591740, "timestamp_updated": 1395591740, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.519999980926513672", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9606770", "author": {"steamid": "76561198083408588", "personaname": "Bengis Bongis", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198083408588/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 5100, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1772, "last_played": 1512621099, "avatar": "a2c1ff4c76ff7f7f62f90670390d82f2390140bb"}, "language": "english", "review": "For that inner child inside you begging for a chance to be remembered. Risk of Rain features stylized graphics, platforming/shooting gameplay, dozens of collectables, and countless swarms of enemies that will bring many back to the 16-bit era. Another great throwback is the great co-op play. 4 Friends can play locally (yes, locally), or more can play online. Be warned: this game is hard, and it literally gets harder the longer your session. However, that just makes it all the more rewarding. Level wise, each session contains the same amount of levels, but the kind of levels and the item placement in said levels is random. And, for the icing on the cake, there are ten playable characters to choose from (granted, you only get one to start.) To sum up in a few words: Nostalgic, Difficult, Satisfying, Replayable, Cooperative, Fun. Get playing!", "timestamp_created": 1395581709, "timestamp_updated": 1395581709, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9600545", "author": {"steamid": "76561198125626866", "personaname": "Vardha", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/vardha/", "num_games_owned": 786, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 2488, "playtime_la